# Only what the build reads: anything else in the context would make the cache of the image miss on
# every commit (.git) or every change of the CI, the docs or the chart. The CRDs are there for the
# test that compares them with src/api.rs.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!proto/
!src/
!tests/
!chart/files/crds/
